# Security Policy

## Reporting a Vulnerability

To report a security vulnerability, please email [your-email@example.com] directly. Do not create an issue in the repository.

Please include the following information in your report:
- Description of the vulnerability
- Steps to reproduce the issue
- Suggested fixes (if any)

## Supported Versions

We actively support the following versions of this project:
- Version 1.x.x (latest stable release)
- Version 0.x.x (long-term support)

## Security Updates

Once a security vulnerability has been verified, we will work on a fix and release it as quickly as possible. Security patches will be communicated via GitHub Issues and will be marked as high priority.

We will also publish a security advisory to notify users of the vulnerability and the patch.

## Code of Conduct

This project adheres to the [Contributor Covenant Code of Conduct](link-to-your-code-of-conduct).
